  "description": "Test build of three executes as in League (needs League of Legends Heroes): Evelynn's Last Caress deals x2.4 to targets at 30% health or below, Akali's Perfect Execution's second dash deals up to 200% more by the target's missing health, and Riven keeps Wind Slash for a low or killable champion (or the end of her ult) and it deals up to 200% more by missing health instead of 8% max health (the main pack scales them by their own hits or fires at once, since data cannot read health). Other champions are untouched. Writes a log for testing.",
